:: bed
<<scenery bed>>
<<if $player.sleeping>>\
	As the sun reveals the world to a nice Monday morning, you climb out of bed, ready to start a new day. <<- either("The birds chip happily in the morning sun and the trees rustle alive in the early breeze.", "The morning sun shines through your room, illuminating it in a nice warm glow.")>>
	<<set $player.sleeping to false>>\
<<else>>\
	You currently stand in the middle of your cozy small bedroom.
<</if>>\
<<unlessLateToJob>>\
    <<keyOption "Leave your room" main 🚪>>
    <<keyOption "Watch porn" watchPorn 💗>>: 30min
    <<if $player.workedToday>>\
        <<keyOption Sleep sleep 😴>>
    <</if>>\
<</unlessLateToJob>>\
:: sleep
<<set $player.sleeping to true
Now.skipTo("7:00 AM")>>\
<<include bed>>
:: main
<<scenery mainRoom>>
You are currently standing in the middle of the main room of your house.
	
''Is there something you want to do in here?''
<<unlessLateToJob>>\
    <<keyOption "Watch TV" watchTv 📺>>: 30min
    <<include workOption>>\
    <<keyOption "Go outside" home 🚪>>
    <<keyOption "The Basement" basement 🔒>>
    <<keyOption "Your Bedroom" bed 🛌>>
<</unlessLateToJob>>\
:: watchTv
<<addMinutes 30>>\
@@color:yellow;You spend the next half hour skimming through channels and shows.@@
<<include main>>\
:: watchPorn
<<addMinutes 30>>\
@@color:yellow;You spend the next half hour skimming through porn and jerking off.@@
<<include bed>>\
:: basement
<<scenery basement>>
You are currently in your basement.
<<unlessLateToJob>>\
    <<if $slaves.length > 0>>\
        Slaves:
        <<set _slaveIndex to 0>>\
        <<for _slave range $slaves>>\
            <<print "<<link '_slave.name (_slave.age y.o. _slave.hairColor hair)' slave>><<set $slave to " + JSON.stringify(_slave) + ", $slave.index to " + _slaveIndex + ">><</link>>">>
            <<set _slaveIndex++>>\
        <</for>>\
    <</if>>
    <<keyOption "Go back upstairs" main 🚪>>
    <<include workOption>>\
<</unlessLateToJob>>\
:: slave
<<scenery basement>>
You approach $slave.name
<<include slaveStats>>
$slave.genPronoun nerviously looks at you with $slave.possesive $slave.eyeColor eyes

<<keyOption "Push $slave.pronoun down" slavePushedDown 👇>>
<<keyOption "Leave $slave.pronoun alone" basement ✋>>
:: slavePushedDown
<<scenery basement>>
You push $slave.name down placing your body over.
<<if $slave.fear gt 25>>\
    $slave.genPronoun trembles in fear under your shadow.
<</if>>\

<<keyOption "Strip $slave.pronoun naked" slaveStrip 👌>>
<<keyOption "Leave $slave.pronoun alone" basement ✋>>
:: slaveStrip
<<scenery basement>>
You take off all $slave.possesive clothes leaving $slave.name completely naked in front of you.

<<keyOption "Penetrate $slave.pronoun" slavePenetrate 🍆>>
<<keyOption "Leave $slave.pronoun alone" basement ✋>>
:: slavePenetrate
<<scenery basement>>
You forcefully push your dick inside $slave.name and start to fuck $slave.pronoun.
$slave.genPronoun starts crying and whimpering.
<<set $slave.fear to Math.min(100, $slave.fear + 50), $slaves[$slave.index].fear = $slave.fear>>\
